        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MCDONALD & ASSOCIATES - EXPERIENCED, PROFESSIONAL, TRUSTED - are delighted to offer to the market this Beautiful & Spacious 3 Bed Family Home presented in Excellent Condition throughout. \n\nBoasting Numerous Features, this truly 'Turn-Key' Property is located in a Private Cul-de-Sac within walking distance to Train Station, Schools, Shops, Town Centre & All Amenities. \n\nExtending to approximately 1,330sq.ft., accommodation of this Superb Home is comprised of Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Area, Conservatory, 3 Bedrooms, Family Bathroom & En-Suite. \n\nThis Large Family Home has been Lovingly Maintained over the Years and is Tastefully Decorated throughout.\n\nIn the Kitchen/Dining Area there is a Quality Fitted Kitchen with Oven, Hob, Washing Machine, Fridge Freezer & Additional Fridge. The Kitchen Area with Tiled Floor & Splashback also has a Water Softener. \n\nFrom the Dining Area you access the Light Filled Conservatory with French Doors to the Private Rear Garden. The Low Maintenance & Landscaped Garden is an Idyllic Setting for Family & Social Gatherings. \n\nA Quality Metal Shed with Timber Floor offers Storage for your Gardening Items. \n\nIn the Expansive Living Room with Bay Window there is a Feature Solid Fuel Open Fireplace and French Doors to the Dining Area. \n\nThe W.C. on the Ground Floor has a Beautiful Feature Window. \n\nThe Entrance Hall with Tiled Floor is accessed by a Composite Front Door Installed in Recent Years. \n\nThe Main Bedroom with Floor to Ceiling Fitted Wardrobes has an En-Suite with Partially Tiled Walls & Tiled Shower Area. \n\nThe Family Bathroom has a Velux Window, with Partially Tiled Wall & Bath Area with Overhead Shower. \n\nAll Bedrooms are Double Rooms with the benefit of Floor to Ceiling Fitted Wardrobes also in Bedroom 2. \n\nA Stira Ladder accesses the Partially Floored Attic providing Ample Storage. \n\nThere is a Cobble Lock Driveway with Off Street Parking to the Front. \n\nWith Alarm & CCTV, this Fantastic Home Must be Viewed to be Appreciated. \n\nThe First to See will Buy, Let's make it yours! \n\nServices: Mains Water, Sewerage, Electricity & High-Speed Broadband. Oil Fired Central Heating. \n\nBuilt c. 2000.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nLiving Room - 4.663m X 4.517m\nKitchen/Dining Area - 7.071m X 3.866m\nConservatory - 2.780m X 2.552m\nW.C. - 1.544m X 0.787m\nBedroom 1 - 4.306m X 3.287m\nEn-Suite - 2.448m X 1.429m\nBedroom 2 - 3.865m X 3.060m\nBedroom 3 - 2.872m X 2.832m\nBathroom - 2.515m X 1.884m\n\nVIEWING STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT WITH SOLE SELLING AGENTS TOM MCDONALD & ASSOCIATES. No information, statement, description, quantity or measurement contained in any sales particulars or given orally or contained in any webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report, docket or hand out issued by or on behalf of Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor in respect of the property shall constitute a representation or a condition or a warranty on behalf of Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor. Any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis-description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor. All bidders must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all of the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Tom McDonald & Assoc. or the vendor.\n"
